THIRD-PARTY DEPENDENCIES
------------------------
This project builds against JUCE (https://juce.com), which is dual-licensed
under the GNU GPLv3 and a Steinberg/JUCE commercial licence. Because Bacillum
links JUCE, any *binary redistribution* must comply with JUCE's GPLv3 terms
unless the author holds a commercial JUCE licence. The VST3 SDK pulled in by
JUCE is likewise dual-licensed (GPLv3 / Steinberg proprietary).

Unit tests build against Catch2 (https://github.com/catchorg/Catch2),
licensed under the Boost Software License 1.0.

